{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "PointwiseLiftProvenance",
    "description": "Per-term provenance through the pointwise lift (esm-spec 10.5). Chem's decay, Src's emission and Adv's upwind stencil are three contributions to D(Chem.O3); the lift indexes each one per cell and wraps their sum in one faq, so body(eq) is the faq body and the contributions are the per-cell terms.",
